      "en": "Abram said, “Behold, you have given no children to me: and, behold, one born in my house is my heir.”",
      "ko": "아브람이 또 가로되 주께서 내게 씨를 아니주셨으니 내 집에서 길리운 자가 나의 후사가 될것이니이다",
      "source_text_hash": "ba042c93a121acec05d9745c47d73a667ee7edf75eccbda5382374ba07e25025",
      "translation_text_hash": "8484392f979c627df54e332dd096adcccb7b9b7cc47ba88b9dff776714f439b0",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
