      "en": "When the sun was going down, a deep sleep fell on Abram. Now terror and great darkness fell on him.",
      "ko": "해질 때에 아브람이 깊이 잠든 중에 캄캄함이 임하므로 심히 두려워하더니",
      "source_text_hash": "099d7eb125173a19b8a9543c3fbe01bfa60f699a85107d0d1217a6b095e45faf",
